{
    // Ray tracing light presets (read by RT64's WcwRaytracer; reloaded when this file changes).
    // "default" applies to any venue not matched below. A venue is recognized by its "match" list of world texture
    // hashes (WCW_RT_VENUE_LOG=1 prints the current scene's candidates; the Lighting editor's "New venue from scene"
    // writes one).
    // Fields: center [x, y, z] (receiver center on X/Z, key light height on Y), spread, fills, keyWeight, size (light
    // panel width), radius (shadow receiver radius), shadow, characterShadow, clearance, falloff, anchor ("scene":
    // offsets from the drawn scene's center and floor), or "lights": [[x, y, z, weight], ...] to place up to 8 lights
    // explicitly (these cast the shadows).
    // Colored light: "color" [r, g, b] tints every light (white = none; normalized, so brightness stays the same),
    // "keyColor" / "fillColor" for the generated rig, [x, y, z, weight, r, g, b] for one light.
    // Glows: [[x, y, z, intensity, range(, r, g, b(, flicker))], ...] (up to 4) add light in all directions, also
    // outside the radius; they light traced geometry (floor, ramp, sets), never crowd sprites or screens. The color is
    // not normalized (it scales the glow); flicker 0..1 = a failing tube that blinks off now and then.
    // "outsideDarkness" (0..1) darkens everything beyond the receiver radius (crowd, arena, wrestlers out there), easing
    // in over "outsideEdge"; "litAreas" [[x, z, radius, edge], ...] (up to 2) are places with their own light that stay
    // out of that darkness.
    //
    // WCW vs. nWo World Tour (rigged 2026-10-12 with the AkiMods quickmatch mod + free camera): one arena in four
    // federation themes (the rules screen's "Arena": WCW, NWO, DOA, IU). "WCW" lists the textures all four share, so it
    // must stay FIRST: in the other themes it also matches fully and the later (themed) venue wins the tie.
    "default": {
        "center": [0, 650, 0],
        "lights": [[0, 650, 0, 2], [-320, 600, -320, 1], [320, 600, -320, 1], [-320, 600, 320, 1], [320, 600, 320, 1]],
        "size": 20,
        "radius": 650,
        "shadow": 0.6,
        "characterShadow": 0.35
    },
    "venues": [
